<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia's QTC 2007 bond tender yields 7.603.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia's QTC 2007 bond tender yields 7.603.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Queensland Treasury Corporation (QTC) said its tender of its 8.0 percent September 2007 stock produced an weighted average yield (WAY) of 7.603 percent.</p>
<p> OFFERED A$100 MLN     COUPON   8.0 PCT     MATURITY  14.09.07</p>
<p> TYPE    SEMI/GOVT     WAY	7.603 pct   SETT DATE 11.02.97</p>
<p> ALLOTTED A$100 MLN    RANGE    7.60-7.605</p>
<p>QTC is the central borrowing authority for the state of Queensland.</p>
<p>--Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
